---
import HeroMotion from './HeroMotion.astro';
---

<section class="hero-personal" aria-labelledby="consulting-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow red">Product leadership · People, process, technology</p>
    <h1 id="consulting-title">
      <span>Senior product leadership</span>
      <span>that <em class="red">makes work move.</em></span>
    </h1>
    <HeroMotion kind="converge" />
    <div class="hero-lower">
      <p>I work with product teams to untangle difficult problems, align people across functions, and put AI to practical use.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button" href="#contact">Let's talk <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="text-link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/brandonkeao/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">See my experience <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="experience-strip wrap" aria-label="Experience">
  <p class="eyebrow">Experience includes · Employers and clients</p>
  <ul class="company-list">
    <li>Rebrandly</li>
    <li>Pie Insurance</li>
    <li>Bitly</li>
    <li>PAIRIN</li>
    <li>Ora Interactive</li>
    <li>Sears</li>
    <li>Bridgewater</li>
    <li>Bloomberg</li>
    <li>Goldman Sachs</li>
    <li>Deutsche Bank</li>
    <li>Capital Group</li>
    <li>Thomson Reuters</li>
    <li>Saxo Bank</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<section class="section landing-opportunities" id="opportunities" aria-labelledby="opportunity-title">
  <div class="wrap section-grid">
    <div class="opportunity-intro section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow red">01 / Working together</p>
      <h2 id="opportunity-title">Good work starts<br />with the right fit.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="opportunities">
      <article class="opportunity">
        <h3>Consulting &amp; fractional</h3>
        <p>A difficult initiative, a product team that needs support, or a system that needs untangling. Start with the problem and work out the right contribution.</p>
        <p class="fine">For smaller-team Head of Product work, I prefer to begin fractionally and learn about the fit together.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="opportunity">
        <h3>Staff / Principal product roles</h3>
        <p>Hands-on product leadership within a midsize or larger company. Broad problems, meaningful ownership, and a team that values thoughtful collaboration.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Talk about the opportunity <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section approach" id="approach" aria-labelledby="approach-title">
  <div class="wrap section-grid">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow red">02 / How I work</p>
      <h2 id="approach-title">Builder first.<br />Team always.</h2>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="approach-statement">I care about things that <em>actually work.</em></p>
      <p class="approach-detail">Useful products. Clear decisions. Teams with room to do good work. My path runs from engineering and consulting through product leadership. I see things as systems, stay close to the work, and believe leadership comes from everywhere.</p>
      <div class="approach-links">
        <a class="text-link" href="/about/">More about me <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="text-link" href="/manager-readme/">My Manager README <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section landing-work" id="work" aria-labelledby="work-title">
  <div class="wrap section-grid">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow red">03 / The work</p>
      <h2 id="work-title">Some problems don't fit in one team.</h2>
      <p>That's where I like to work: connecting the customer, the system, and the people who need to make it happen.</p>
      <div class="work-links">
        <a class="text-link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/brandonkeao/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore my career on LinkedIn <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="work-rows">
      <article class="work-row">
        <span class="eyebrow">01</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Teams pulling in different directions.</h3>
          <p>Make the problem clear, build alignment, and help the team move together—from the first difficult decision through delivery.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="work-row">
        <span class="eyebrow">02</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Billing and platform complexity.</h3>
          <p>Understand how the work really happens across product, engineering, finance, and operations. Find the constraint and a practical way forward.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="work-row">
        <span class="eyebrow">03</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Using AI in everyday work.</h3>
          <p>Try AI on a real task, check the result, and keep what improves the work. The tools change. The need for judgment doesn't.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="contact-band on-red" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
  <div class="wrap contact-inner">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Start a conversation</p>
      <h2 id="contact-title">What needs to move?</h2>
      <p>Tell me about the team, the problem, and where things are getting stuck.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="button paper" href="/contact/">Get in touch <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </div>
</section>
